rooms_desc ({"You are in beautiful hall covered with carpets.You can hear Acheron's voice telling you Vitaj priatelu.","You are in very nice furnished livingroom. Acheron likes to make partyhere. You can see large fireplace near wall. The room is pleasant warm.You can see big table and several chairs in the center of the roomWalls are covered by paintings of Acheron's friends.","Big room with several shelves by the north wallAcheron always store his tools here","Veery big treasuryFull of chests and dozes with coins","Very nice bedroom with very large nice bed in center. This is the placeWhere Acheron spends most of his free time.You see various weapons andarmours hanging on the wall. You wonder where are the from.","Long dark corridor.","Nice bathroom with very big bath tube in the center","You are in pentagon room of Acheron's house.Walls are black covered by red insignias. This place look very mysterious.You wonder why? The room is almost empty. The only item here is big blackaltar in the center of the room.",0,0,})
